{
  "id": "2SA.12",
  "number": "12",
  "bookId": "2SA",
  "reference": "2 Samweli 12",
  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "12",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2SA 12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama atuma Natani ahali Daudi. Amugoba amugambira ati, “Omu kigo kimoi habaire halimu abantu babili, omoi mutungi ondijo mworo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omutungi abaire aina amahyo g'entaama n'embuzi n'ente zingi muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe omworo abaire ataina kantu shana akahagazi k'entama kamoi konkai akabaire aguzire. Abaire akagabire kakulira omwe nk'abaanabe, kabaire kalya obukunkumukwabwe, kanywa aha kikompekye, kamurara omu kifuba. Kabaire nikamushusira omwana muhara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiro kimoi omutungi ogwo aizire yaralilirwa omugenyi, kyonkai tiyagonza kumubagira ntama anga mbuzi omu mahyoge. Akwete akataama k'omworo yaba niko amwitira.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Daudi agilira omushaija ogwo ekiniga kingi muno. Agambira Natani ati, “Ninahira obuso bw'Omukama, omushaija akozire eki mazima afe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mara akataama abanze akalihe emirundi enai aha rw'okuba tagizire buganyizi, akozire kubi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natani agambira Daudi ati, “Omushaija ogwo niwe. Omukama Ruhanga wa Isiraeli nagamba ati, ‘Nkakukora amajuta kuba Mukama wa Isiraeli, mara nakuhungya omu mikono ya Shauli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkakuha enju ya Mukama wawe n'abakazibe kukutagasa. Nakuha engoma ya Isiraeli n'eya Yuda. Ebi kabyakubaire bili bike nakukwongeireho ebindi nk'ebi n'okushagaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kubaki ogahire emihango yange okanfakalira? Uria Omuhiti omwitire omu ndashana washuba washwera mukaziwe. Omwisize Abaamoni omu ndashana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu orwo ongahire, okashwera na muka Uria, baijukuru bawe balita kugwa omu ndashana.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Omukama nashuba nagamba ati, ‘Ndarahura omuntu omu ka yawe akutabangure. Ekyo orakimanya orwo ndakwaka abakazi bawe nkabaha mutahi wawe, abyame nabo omushana gujwire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwe okikozire bwesheleke, kyonkai inye ndakikora omushana gujwire omu maisho ga Isiraeli yona.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi agambira Natani ati “Nfakaliire Omukama.” Natani amugambira ati, “Omukama nawe yakugarulira obufu bwawe, tofe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai orwo ofakaire otyo okamunigaza, omwana ow'omukazi azaire arafa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahanyuma Natani ashuba owe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwana owo muka Uria yazaliire Daudi, Omukama akamuteza endwara yaba kubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orw'ekyo Daudi atagiliza Ruhanga kumukiliza omwanawe. Abyama ahansi n'okulya ayanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaramatabe bamwemelera aha rubaju kumwimukya ahansi, kyonkai tiyakunzire, mara tiyaliire nabo kyakulya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha kiro kya mushanju omwana afa. Abaramatabe batina kukimugambira, bati, “Leba orwo omwana abaire akyarora tumugambiire tiyatuhorora, aho twakumugambira tutai okw'omwana yafa? Yakwekora kubi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai orwo Daudi yaboine nibafumora omu kahwe, ashobokerwa okw'omwana yafire. Ababaza ati, “Isi omwana yafa?” Bamuhorora bati, “Yafa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho aruga ahansi, ayoga, ayesiiga amajuta, ahindura emyendoye, agya nyaruju y'Omukama afukama. Ahanyuma agya omwe, aragira kabamwihulira ekyakulya, alya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaramatabe bamubaza bati, “Kiki eki ekyo wakora? Oyangire kulya, mara walira aha rw'omwana orwo abaire akyarora; mbwenu orwo yafa nirwo waimuka okalya?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abashubamu ati, “Orwo omwana abaire akyarora nyangire kulya mara nalira, aha rw'enshonga mbaire nintekeleza nti rundi Omukama yakungilira ekisha omwana wange akira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu yafire, kubaki nyange kulya? Ninshobora kumugarura? Mbali yagya ndimuhonderayo, kyonkai wenene tiyakungarukira.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahanyuma Daudi amaramara omukaziwe Batisheba. Arara nawe; azara omwana w'omwojo, Daudi amuruka eibara amweta Solomoni. Omukama Ruhanga amugonza, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amukwasa omurangi Natani mara amuragira kumuruka eibara akamweta Yedidia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoabu arashanisa Raba ekigo kikuru ky'Abaamoni, akikwata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atuma entumwa ahali Daudi namumanyisa ati, “Ndashanisize ekigo kya Raba, n'amaizi gakyo nagakwata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho mbwenu oteranise abaisherukare abasigaireho, basisiire omu maisho gakyo oije obe niiwe okikwata, ntakikwata kiketwa ibara lyange.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikwo Daudi kuteranisa abaisherukare bona akagenda Raba, agitera agikwata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aihya Omukama w'Abaamoni orukinga omu mutwe, mara rwinamu eibare ly'eiguzi, kandi obusikizi bwarwo nk'ekilo 35. Orukinga orwo akarwejwalira. Kandi omu kigo ekyo akanyagamu ebintu bingi muno. ",
          "type": "text",
